    "description": "Blackberry\nBlackberry Messenger (BBM)\nSenior Software Developer\nJan 2014 – Present\n\nProject Description:\nBBM needed to monetize its cross platform messaging application. Crucial features were decided upon from a product perspective and needed to be rolled out under high pressure conditions. Additional features were also added on the BlackBerry 10 platform in order to differentiate it from other ecosystems.\n\nTasks Performed:\t\n•\tDesigned External Partner API layer to support deep integrations into the BBM platform\n•\tRepresented BBM in meetings with Partners that were early adopters of the API platform in order to fine tune the design and roll out the initial deployments\n•\tLead feature teams of 5 internal developers responsible for delivering crucial feature into the product\n•\tWorked with multiple primes to design the Data At Rest Protection plan for BBM\n•\tPrototyped and implemented features on the BBM Android and IOS applications\nEnvironment:\tAndroid , Java,  IOS , Objective C, BlackBerry 10\n\n",
